        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Conditional vs. Unconditional Lien Waivers: How They Work and When to Sign
        </h1>
        <AuthorByline />
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-400">
          Published June 23, 2026 · Updated October 7, 2026 · 9 min read
        </p>
      </div>

